  "subject": "six office friends dressed as a box of egg tarts in the South Stand at the first Hong Kong Sevens at Kai Tak, dancing all weekend and missing every try, including the one in the final",
  "caption": "Cantonese-language Brazilian funk carioca, Rio baile funk in the tamborzão style. A programmed tamborzão drum loop of electronic congas and atabaque hits, a booming distorted 808 kick with sub-bass, sharp hand claps, a referee whistle blown on the downbeats, and a short squelchy synth-bass stab answering each chant. Loud, raw, bass-heavy soundsystem mix, dry and in-your-face. A male and a female Cantonese MC trading short punchy call-and-response lines, with a rowdy crowd shouting the hook back. 130 BPM, F# minor. Rowdy, silly, sweaty all-day stadium party. No trap hi-hats, no reggaeton dembow, no EDM build or drop, no pop synth chords, no funk-rock guitar or slap bass, no autotune.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n啟德新球場 禮拜六朝早\n排咗三個鐘 先入到南看台\n六個同事 扮六件蛋撻\n最大隻嗰個 仲孭住個紙盒\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n人哋問 今場邊隊打邊隊\n我哋話 唔知 跳咗先\n\n[Chorus]\n蛋撻 蛋撻 跳到彈起\n酥皮甩晒 都唔理\n個波喺邊 冇人睇\n南看台 我哋最大聲\n\n[Verse]\n隔籬班人 扮晒 Minion 同牛仔\n後面成排 扮晒港鐵車卡\n大螢幕 影到我哋六個\n成場人 一齊叫 蛋撻\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n人哋問 頭先邊個達陣\n我哋話 唔知 跳咗先\n\n[Chorus]\n蛋撻 蛋撻 跳到彈起\n個餡甩咗一半 都唔理\n個波喺邊 冇人睇\n大螢幕 再影多我哋一次\n\n[Verse]\n禮拜日 決賽終於開波\n我哋六個 坐低想睇\n孭紙盒嗰個 話去買啤酒\n我哋陪佢排 排咗成個鐘\n\n[Verse]\n條隊兜咗 三個樓梯口\n個紙盒 畀汗浸到腍晒\n前面阿叔 問幾錢一個\n我哋六個 擺好甫士 畀佢影\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n收銀姐姐問 幾多比幾多\n我哋話 唔知 飲咗先\n\n[Bridge]\n成個球場 突然震一震\n我哋喺走廊 聽到有人叫 達陣\n六件蛋撻 攬住一齊跳\n\n[Chorus]\n蛋撻 蛋撻 跳到彈起\n決賽達陣 我哋冇睇\n個波喺邊 我哋唔知\n排隊嗰度 我哋最大聲\n\n[Outro]\n蛋撻 蛋撻 聽年再嚟",
